crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=903eebbadf8d99f1c5be3ea460778423, https://si.imgix.net/0d3b3cdd/uploads/origins/5d06703f-7ced-45a9-940f-acfc99f8004b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bae8f37a4a3f79f80a2cf339423e9629 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0d3b3cdd/uploads/origins/5d06703f-7ced-45a9-940f-acfc99f8004b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0056aea501f05b5befa4dddce7dad4d5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "你好！你的画作太棒了，我希望能请你画我的角色！她是一位肤色黝黑的狐娘，头顶和尾巴上都覆盖着史莱姆。这种史莱姆具有魔法力量，能创造出各种不同的物体和形态，她还能将自身部分身体转化为史莱姆！她通常以酷炫的形象出现，但很容易害羞。\n\n绘制风格完全由您自由发挥！若您愿意，可启用NSFW模式，但具体选择权交由您决定。感谢您的考虑。https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1eTG5UOn0QEcpLyvgbHj3isFf8OXzyA-B", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SeiranAichi/works/104", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/57dc614b/uploads/origins/8c9e2551-b981-40d6-8327-781208b68b3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e1588b45efc08e1890d071c574f31f37", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/57dc614b/uploads/origins/8c9e2551-b981-40d6-8327-781208b68b3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e1588b45efc08e1890d071c574f31f37, https://si.imgix.net/57dc614b/uploads/origins/8c9e2551-b981-40d6-8327-781208b68b3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=710cc484a6f8f58eb48a59400a5e5b13 2x, https://si.imgix.net/57dc614b/uploads/origins/8c9e2551-b981-40d6-8327-781208b68b3d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=406c54ea95cf7ad479f86452a356215a 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "我想委托创作一幅NSFW风格的艺术作品，描绘两位角色：莫菲（Morphy）和玛琪雅（Makeeya）。莫菲是位绿发骑士，玛琪雅则是红发幽灵。他们是恋人。请将他们描绘在床上，激烈交欢。参考链接：https://imgur.com/a/rYA5nhA https://imgur.com/a/rYA5nhA", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SeiranAichi/works/103", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1d5d7c06/uploads/origins/1d131ab9-5288-47f5-ab65-115d99fcf283?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6b7b3832a7a2d263c7cca26094454eda", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1d5d7c06/uploads/origins/1d131ab9-5288-47f5-ab65-115d99fcf283?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6b7b3832a7a2d263c7cca26094454eda, https://si.imgix.net/1d5d7c06/uploads/origins/1d131ab9-5288-47f5-ab65-115d99fcf283?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e09b9bdaf60084edad62c8cd7ce86a14 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1d5d7c06/uploads/origins/1d131ab9-5288-47f5-ab65-115d99fcf283?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=81c242b9b46c99ea93018ade2172ca15 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "我想要一幅以《崩坏：星穹铁道》中的萤和海怪为主题的水下艺术作品。萤穿着比基尼。https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/132877844 https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/120525346 https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/120263076\n以下是比基尼设计的参考素材。萤火虫的比基尼不可透视，乳头与私密部位不可暴露且不可见。海怪应为大型细长鳗鱼状生物，基础参考图为：https://www.pixiv.net/artworks/127008867 及 https://imgur.com/4Ppt2KK\n\n需对参考图中的怪物进行修改：发光\"牙齿\"应改为发光触手。除蓝色发光特征和眼睛外，身体由阴影构成且不反射光线。色彩与简化细节参考见https://imgur.com/x2xrAPy或https://imgur.com/lHsO5ax\n\n构图需参照https://xa-colors.tumblr.com/post/651330685934665728，但需调整为怪物尾部穿过萤火虫双腿之间，其躯干或尾鳍摩擦萤火虫胯部使其产生情欲反应。怪物体型应略大于参考图中的鳗鱼。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SeiranAichi/works/102", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/050a4614/uploads/origins/1b9ebea9-1b20-4c96-b5f7-522fbb99af26?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22f1b4f09b9af048ecadce3cea33eba8", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/050a4614/uploads/origins/1b9ebea9-1b20-4c96-b5f7-522fbb99af26?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=22f1b4f09b9af048ecadce3cea33eba8, https://si.imgix.net/050a4614/uploads/origins/1b9ebea9-1b20-4c96-b5f7-522fbb99af26?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c54bd24be1e2d13994cd07685dcfb824 2x, https://si.imgix.net/050a4614/uploads/origins/1b9ebea9-1b20-4c96-b5f7-522fbb99af26?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fcf5e4facad2053fbea9c2e009fb5e07 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "你好，我想请求绘制我的原创角色西尔菲娅和蒂奥娜的同框图。请尽可能突出西尔菲娅（190cm）与蒂奥娜（240cm）的身高差异。\n西尔菲亚正以后入式与体型庞大的蒂奥娜交合。两人神情宛如动物交配般沉溺于欢愉之中。若可行，请另绘蒂奥娜被西尔菲亚精液充盈后的版本，可尝试不同表情。创作细节请自由调整，期待您的作品！\n\n西尔菲娅：https://photos.app.goo.gl/mftS8tnNgCQt2u7M8蒂奥娜：https://photos.app.goo.gl/LETe7irs1cRXcwW9A姿势参考：https://photos.app.goo.gl/iz2Zcr7w5oQgvrA5A", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SeiranAichi/works/101", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/56acf09f/uploads/origins/6b29c552-4c1c-44df-b2a0-da9f99af3f19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5ce2af9845c6205c2a29f8bb27b4b9f2", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/56acf09f/uploads/origins/6b29c552-4c1c-44df-b2a0-da9f99af3f19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5ce2af9845c6205c2a29f8bb27b4b9f2, https://si.imgix.net/56acf09f/uploads/origins/6b29c552-4c1c-44df-b2a0-da9f99af3f19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1e118526c919d33ce1d4836f5d827225 2x, https://si.imgix.net/56acf09f/uploads/origins/6b29c552-4c1c-44df-b2a0-da9f99af3f19?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=609fa59826fed5a1e390cccbe3c122cc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SeiranAichi/works/100", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/15c2c056/uploads/origins/7151141a-b6e3-42cd-977d-cd06c8c9a937?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a0fd4ec22eed7442ef5972d3e23b499a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/15c2c056/uploads/origins/7151141a-b6e3-42cd-977d-cd06c8c9a937?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a0fd4ec22eed7442ef5972d3e23b499a, https://si.imgix.net/15c2c056/uploads/origins/7151141a-b6e3-42cd-977d-cd06c8c9a937?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=892452b7d7dc2034840a75b7372facb3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/15c2c056/uploads/origins/7151141a-b6e3-42cd-977d-cd06c8c9a937?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10f4dfa4e1a7a5c3d94a48f4fdd00d71 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "初次见面，我从新作品列表中被您的过往作品吸引而来。若您方便的话，能否接受我的委托呢？委托对象是以已停服网游中的我的角色为原型的虚拟女孩。她性格端庄却暗藏猥琐，身材苗条胸围适中，臀部是她的性感带。\n\n・需求内容请按以下格式罗列：请为她穿上\"委托服装（礼服或夏装）\"文件夹中的服饰（或从\"其他服装\"文件夹中挑选您喜欢的款式）佩戴犬耳，并在臀部插入带尾巴的插件（需呈现尾巴从臀部自然伸出的形态，避免露出插件基座）\n与恋人亲密缠绵的性爱场景，若可能请移除尾巴进行肛交 需呈现全情投入扮演犬类或因臀部刺激而愉悦的状态 要求展现朦胧迷离的快感表情 对方形象可省略 胸部尺寸偏小（B罩杯至平坦均可） 服装状态请设定为着装至半裸程度 需露出面部，其他构图可自由发挥 恳请予以考虑\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1gXZVDfcsl66QZ8VxPLKFXERqQXKioNsJ", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SeiranAichi/works/99", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1a3558b6/uploads/origins/463da00c-f83c-4e26-8e0f-874738a8f64d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d6596954ecdae224ad92988ad4af5f03", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1a3558b6/uploads/origins/463da00c-f83c-4e26-8e0f-874738a8f64d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d6596954ecdae224ad92988ad4af5f03, https://si.imgix.net/1a3558b6/uploads/origins/463da00c-f83c-4e26-8e0f-874738a8f64d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&