请求创作《Granblue Fantasy》中莱莉娅的漫画。这将是上次请求的续集。\n\n故事情节是，莉雅再次遇到狼，害羞地向狼展示自己的阴部，期待狼继续舔舐。狼给了她一个问候式的舔舐，莉雅非常享受，但当狼停下来绕到她身后时，莉雅感到困惑。莉雅蹲下并张开阴部，希望引诱狼继续舔。\n\n狼却把丽雅推倒，骑在她身上。当狼用它那犬科大阴茎拍打她的阴部和腹部时，莉雅感到震惊和恐慌，因为它未能插入而沮丧地挺动着。\n\n莉雅试图爬开，但这样做会使她的阴部角度更适合插入。狼胜利地嚎叫着夺走了丽雅的贞操。狼会让莉雅成为它的交配母狗。最后，莉雅被精液灌满，发出淫荡的尖叫。\n\n参考资料\nhttps://catbox.moe/c/i4boj3\n\n其他细节由您自行决定。\n感谢您的考虑。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SeiranAichi/works/84", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/891b8c0f/uploads/origins/203e9517-3967-4f74-95ab-e4d26cba9073?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f14584edd5e6a3b06cdbd3ae9a419ac5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/891b8c0f/uploads/origins/203e9517-3967-4f74-95ab-e4d26cba9073?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=f14584edd5e6a3b06cdbd3ae9a419ac5, https://si.imgix.net/891b8c0f/uploads/origins/203e9517-3967-4f74-95ab-e4d26cba9073?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=181b6c9ed008d362580d65a6fd361fb9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/891b8c0f/uploads/origins/203e9517-3967-4f74-95ab-e4d26cba9073?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=c9bb6a30129b031f87d53a913a0e140c 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@SeiranAichi/works/83", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ca699591/uploads/origins/5e31845d-0dce-424d-b767-f329dd22ac7e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=cc3b88